[size=5][b]📦 Requirements & Compatibility[/b][/size]

[size=4][b]Required Mods:[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*] [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/588030/Derail_Valley/][b]Derail Valley[/b][/url] (Latest PC / Steam release)
[*] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/21][b]Unity Mod Manager (UMM)[/b][/url] (v0.27.0 or newer)
[*] [url=https://github.com/WhistleWiz/dv-signals][b]DV Signals[/b][/url] (Required for block occupancy and physical signal logic)
[*] [url=https://github.com/Killermops27/dv-ai-traffic][b]CommsRadioAPI[/b][/url] (Required for Comms Radio dispatch mode)
[/list]

[size=4][b]Strongly Recommended & Compatible Mods:[/b][/size]
[list]
[*] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/derailvalley/mods/808][b]Double Track (DoubleTrack)[/b][/url]: [i]Strongly recommended[/i] to prevent single-line gridlock.
[*] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/derailvalley/mods/813][b]Zeibach's Couplers (ZCouplers)[/b][/url]: Fully compatible with AI stress breakage immunity.
[*] [b]PassengerJobs[/b], [b]PersistentJobsMod[/b], [b]SelfShunt[/b]: Fully compatible.
[/list]

[hr]

[size=5][b]🛠️ Installation[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*] Download [b]AITraffic-v0.2.2.zip[/b] from the Files tab.
[*] Drag and drop the archive directly into the Unity Mod Manager [b]Mods[/b] tab, OR extract into your [i]Derail Valley/Mods/[/i] folder.
[*] Start Derail Valley and verify that [b]AI Traffic[/b], [b]DVSignals[/b], and [b]CommsRadioAPI[/b] show green status lights in UMM (Ctrl+F10).
[/list]

